/E (The Stock Analytics Dashboard is an interactive and data-driven web application developed using Streamlit and Python to simplify stock market analysis. It integrates real-time financial data through the Yahoo Finance API along with support for historical data via CSV file uploads, enabling users to perform both live and offline analysis. The platform is designed to provide a comprehensive view of stock performance through advanced data visualization techniques and analytical tools.)
