/E (They developed a Long Short-Term Memory \(LSTM\) model for predicting stock prices. The study focused on time-series forecasting, where LSTM was used to capture long-term dependencies in stock market data. The research showed that LSTM networks are effective in handling sequential data because they can remember previous patterns and use them for future predictions. The author concluded that LSTM performs better than traditional machine learning models in financial time-series forecasting.)
