/E (The system should be easy to use even for beginners, with a simple layout and clear navigation using Streamlit.The system is built with a strong focus on usability, providing a clean, simple, and intuitive interface using Streamlit. The layout is designed in such a way that users can easily navigate between different sections such as data input, analysis, and visualization. Even users with little or no technical background can understand how to operate the dashboard. Clear labels, organized menus, and interactive elements such as buttons and sliders make it easy to perform tasks like selecting stocks, uploading data, and viewing results. This simplicity enhances accessibility and encourages more users to explore stock market analysis.)
