/S /P
/P 297 0 R
/E (The system also generates Buy/Sell signals based on Moving Average crossover strategy, helping users identify potential entry and exit points in the market.)
/Pg 60 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
972 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
