/Title (6.Stock prediction using machine learning: The system should use a simple ML model \(Linear Regression\) to predict future stock prices based on historical data.The system incorporates a basic machine learning model, such as Linear Regression, to predict future stock prices based on historical data. The model learns patterns and relationships from past price movements and uses this information to estimate future trends. By analyzing historical features like closing prices and time-based patterns, the model attempts to forecast short-term price movements. Although stock market predictions are inherently uncertain and may not always be accurate due to external factors, this feature provides users with an approximate idea of future trends. It adds an intelligent and predictive layer to the system, helping users make more informed and data-driven investment decisions.)
/Dest [26 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 2428 0 R
/Next 2432 0 R
>>
endobj
